  "name": "Question 9",
  "problem": "A private art studio can enroll between $8$ and $14$ students in a painting workshop. The fee that each student pays is $$72$ if exactly $8$ students enroll, and if more than $8$ students are enrolled, the fee drops by $$4$ for each additional student. Each student pays the same fee.\n\nHow many students must the workshop have to maximize its revenue?\n\nTo maximize its revenue, the workshop must have\n{{field-1}}\nstudents.",
